  "plan": "Write cli_tool.cpp that: loads weights.json via cJSON, decodes the PNG via lodepng (grayscale = red channel), runs the MLP forward pass on raw 0-255 pixel values, and prints the argmax digit. Compile with g++ linking cJSON.c and lodepng.cpp. Then run ./cli_tool weights.json image.png to verify, and write the output to prediction.txt.",
